  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_refactor-chat-completions-effect-bundles { name = "refactor-chat-completions-effect-bundles" } (
    <Description ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESRA>
    Characterize, migrate into the AI domain, extract and explicitly compose provider-specific Chat Completions effects without changing observable provider behavior.
    </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESRA>
    <SubNodes [
      <TaskGroup #P1 { name = "Behavior and architecture characterization" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESRB>
