          </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS0>
          <Criterion ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS1>
          Responses API remains on its independent driver.
          </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS1>
        ]>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T3.1" name = "Add official effect bundle contract and implementations" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS2>
            Add an AI-domain contract-level Chat Completions effect bundle shape and OpenAI/DeepSeek official logic implementations for endpoint, message/request projection and stream reasoning policy.
            </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS2>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS3>
              Contract and logic ownership follow existing contract/logic package boundaries.
              </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS3>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS4>
              OpenAI official bundle excludes DeepSeek compatibility fields.
              </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS4>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC3" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS5>
              DeepSeek official bundle preserves real reasoning and repairs only missing historical tool-call fields.
              </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS5>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC4" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS6>
              Bundle implementations reuse the shared core instead of copying its state machine.
              </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS6>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC5" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS7>
              Bundle contract and implementations introduce no ai-organ reverse dependency from symbiont packages.
              </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS7>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.2" name = "Integrate drivers and remove provider heuristics" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS8>
            Inject the official bundles from OpenAIChatDriver and DeepSeekDriver, pass the current request's actual adapter/driver binding through executor and terminal stream callbacks into ingress, and remove isDeepseekRequest plus stream-side adapter-type inference.
            </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS8>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T3.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS9>
              ProviderDriverRegistry selection is the only source of OpenAI-versus-DeepSeek protocol semantics.
              </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESS9>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.2-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESSA>
              Misleading model/Base URL strings do not switch the configured bundle.
              </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESSA>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.2-AC3" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESSB>
              Explicit `adapter: deepseek` works with third-party compatible Base URLs.
              </?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESSB>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.2-AC4" checked = true } ?01M05F1P8AZMENP50Y7HM1ESSC>
